    "detailed_description": "<h1>Alchemist Shop Simulator - run your magic business! - DEMO available now!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY the Demo, please WISHLIST the full game!</h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501120/extras/a700bf72f70c80864775c5e3d157bb4b.avif?t=1751031143\" /></div><br>Experience time from an entirely new perspective, whether you're looking for a challenge, some relaxation, or just a bit of fun. The only task required of a clock is to tick forward every second. Over and over, second by second. Sounds easy, right? But could YOU handle it? Take a deep breath. Unwind. Tap into your inner rhythm. Click once every second. Consistently. Become the clock.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501120/extras/f8b311455443f7b3b571c538bf3c5f61.poster.avif?t=1751031143\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501120/extras/f8b311455443f7b3b571c538bf3c5f61.webm?t=1751031143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501120/extras/f8b311455443f7b3b571c538bf3c5f61.mp4?t=1751031143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get Clock Simulator and...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Discover a novel take on rhythm gaming distilled to one simple idea: become the clock<br></li><li>Enjoy intuitive controls so simple you could play with your eyes closed (maybe you should!)<br></li><li>Challenge yourself at the very basic, innermost level of your very own heartbeat<br></li><li>Master a diverse selection of modes and themes, from the calming to the competitive<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501120/extras/8bcca3f72c3135d077e9e2671b4df5a9.avif?t=1751031143\" /></div><br></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501120/extras/a700bf72f70c80864775c5e3d157bb4b.avif?t=1751031143\" /></div><br>Experience time from an entirely new perspective, whether you're looking for a challenge, some relaxation, or just a bit of fun. The only task required of a clock is to tick forward every second. Over and over, second by second. Sounds easy, right? But could YOU handle it? Take a deep breath. Unwind. Tap into your inner rhythm. Click once every second. Consistently. Become the clock.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501120/extras/f8b311455443f7b3b571c538bf3c5f61.poster.avif?t=1751031143\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501120/extras/f8b311455443f7b3b571c538bf3c5f61.webm?t=1751031143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501120/extras/f8b311455443f7b3b571c538bf3c5f61.mp4?t=1751031143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get Clock Simulator and...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Discover a novel take on rhythm gaming distilled to one simple idea: become the clock<br></li><li>Enjoy intuitive controls so simple you could play with your eyes closed (maybe you should!)<br></li><li>Challenge yourself at the very basic, innermost level of your very own heartbeat<br></li><li>Master a diverse selection of modes and themes, from the calming to the competitive<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501120/extras/8bcca3f72c3135d077e9e2671b4df5a9.avif?t=1751031143\" /></div><br></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Clock Simulator is a mindful game of rhythm and focus in which YOU are the clock. Click once a second, every second. Don't be late. Don't hurry. There's nothing else to be concerned with. Clear your mind and discover new depths of relaxation while becoming time itself!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Polish, Russian, French",
    "reviews": "\u201cClock Simulator is exactly what it sounds like, and it\u2019s fantastic.\u201d<br>7.5 \u2013 GameGrin<br><br>\u201cClock Simulator polecam ka\u017cdemu gdy\u017c mo\u017ce si\u0119 wydawa\u0107, \u017ce to bardzo prosty i monotonny tytu\u0142, ale osobi\u015bcie si\u0119gam do niego cz\u0119\u015bciej w drodze do pracy ni\u017c po kolejne Angry Birds.\u201d<br>8.0 \u2013 Games Guru<br><br>\u201cIf I were a clock, time would collapse on itself [...] because I was too busy swearing to perform the tock that follows the tick.\u201d<br>Rock, Paper, Shotgun<br>",
